    {
      "line_id": "P1L037",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 37,
      "order": 37,
      "text": "6.（1）令f(x)=0，得x^2-4x+3=0，解得x=1或x=3；（2）f(x)=(x-2)^2-1，在[0,4]上，f(0)=3，f(2)=-1，f(4)=3，所以最大值为3，最小值为-1",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "native",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L038",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 38,
      "order": 38,
      "text": "7.（1）S_5=a_1(1-q^5)/(1-q)=1×(1-2^5)/(1-2)=31；（2）a_n=a_1×q^(n-1)=1×2^(n-1)=2^(n-1)",
      "block_type": "text",
